# ASCII Art Web

## Description
A web-based GUI version of the ASCII Art project. It runs a Go HTTP server that serves an interactive webpage where users can type any text, choose a banner style (standard, shadow, or thinkertoy), and see their text rendered as ASCII art directly in the browser. No terminal needed.

